18476b0c-dc71-4014-a689-85b354212012	# Abonnement fixe\n## La solution de téléphonie Orange pour entreprises\n\nL'abonnement fixe est la solution de téléphonie Orange pour entreprises.\nUne offre unique qui garantit performance et économie.\n* Émettre des appels gratuits vers tous les fixes Orange et vers la flotte mobile de l’entreprise.\n* Bénéficier de prix très compétitifs vers les mobiles et fixes de l'Europe.\n* Profiter de remises mensuelles en fonction de votre consommation.\n* Conserver vos équipements et postes téléphoniques.	[-0.020385742,-0.064453125,-0.0076904297,-0.041259766,0.02758789,-0.0055236816,0.010559082,-0.019165039,0.032226562,-0.015197754,-0.04736328,0.06298828,-0.016479492,-0.0073242188,-0.022216797,0.083496094,-0.05517578,-0.0068359375,-0.0074768066,0.064941406,-0.061279297,0.051757812,-0.045410156,0.04736328,0.025268555,-0.016845703,0.02319336,0.027832031,-0.041992188,-0.03857422,0.015563965,-0.032226562,-0.0087890625,0.012817383,0.04638672,-0.009338379,-0.014343262,0.012023926,-0.0067749023,0.056884766,-0.009765625,-0.020141602,-0.035888672,-0.017211914,-0.009277344,-0.0036315918,0.0079956055,0.0035705566,0.026611328,-0.005004883,0.030517578,0.0034484863,-0.045898438,0.029663086,0.014282227,-0.004180908,0.041748047,0.072753906,0.032470703,0.0016098022,-0.032470703,-0.008666992,-0.056396484,-0.036376953,0.0067443848,0.06201172,0.015136719,-0.026611328,-0.057373047,-0.020629883,0.01928711,-0.0013885498,-0.013244629,-0.008911133,-0.02368164,0.03100586,0.039794922,-0.049072266,-0.0067443848,0.009765625,0.022094727,0.018432617,0.07128906,0.014282227,0.03491211,0.017089844,0.06201172,-0.02368164,0.028930664,0.022216797,0.033203125,0.009338379,-0.037597656,-0.023803711,-0.001876831,-0.010375977,-0.059814453,0.016723633,-0.07128906,-0.044921875,-0.0041503906,-0.022216797,-0.010864258,0.010375977,0.008972168,0.05517578,-0.05517578,-0.008300781,0.0023651123,-0.009094238,-0.037841797,-0.018432617,-0.03173828,0.020263672,-0.030395508,0.017089844,0.02