0348b248-572a-411f-b688-4fbfbe9caf9c	# Business BOX (Fixe / 4G)\n## Je n’arrive pas à me connecter avec ma Business Box Fixe/4G\n\nSi les voyants sont éteints :\n* Testez le routeur au niveau d’une autre prise murale et s’assurer que tous les ports liés au routeur sont connectés\n* Si le voyant est rouge ou clignotant:\n* Redémarrez le routeur en débranchant puis rebranchant le câble électrique. Si le problème persiste, retirez la carte SIM du routeur et remettez là .\n\nSi le problème persiste, il faudra prendre contact avec notre centre de relation entreprise aux numéros et horaires indiqués ci-dessous, pour faire les vérifications nécessaires :\n• 7/7J de 08H à 22H ;\n• Au 178 depuis une ligne Orange ;\n• Au 05 20 178 178 ou 06 63 178 178 depuis une autre ligne.	[-0.026245117,-0.050048828,-0.009765625,-0.06542969,0.033203125,-0.016235352,0.0017852783,-0.010620117,-0.008972168,-0.0020751953,-0.013977051,0.006713867,-0.018066406,-0.008972168,-0.022827148,0.08544922,-0.0038604736,-0.057128906,0.048583984,0.080566406,-0.017456055,0.049072266,-0.011962891,0.030517578,0.052246094,0.021240234,-0.019042969,0.061279297,-0.018188477,-0.060546875,0.055664062,-0.029663086,-0.015319824,-0.034179688,0.030639648,-0.012329102,-0.02319336,-0.0115356445,-0.0039978027,0.017211914,0.0099487305,0.020629883,-0.012573242,0.015991211,-0.05053711,-0.019042969,0.028320312,-0.040283203,-0.040039062,-0.017822266,0.03515625,0.043701172,-0.010192871,-0.010070801,0.030883789,0.035888672,0.017944336,0.013061523,-0.00018024445,-0.02355957,-0.07910156,0.012939453,-0.09375,-0.055908203,0.0020751953,0.05126953,0.020874023,-0.046142578,-0.088378906,-0.025024414,-0.0126953125,0.049560547,-0.028442383,0.0013275146,-0.012512207,0.028686523,-0.0029296875,0.032470703,0.017211914,-0.026977539,-0.020629883,0.04711914,-0.025146484,0.022949219,-0.0002822876,0.013427734,0.032714844,-0.0073547363,0.034179688,0.022094727,0.063964844,-0.0134887695,-0.013122559,-0.10253906,0.0079956055,-0.030151367,-0.02758789,0.