f41cd098-8098-416a-a570-1bda075d8bd2	# Comment activer mon forfait Orange ?\n## Activer mon forfait sur le site web [orange.ma](https://espace-client.orange.ma/)\n\n* Une fois la nouvelle carte SIM Orange reçue vous pouvez activer votre ligne sur [votre espace client Orange et moi Web](https://espace-client.orange.ma/).\n* Cliquez sur l’onglet Orange et moi du site web [Orange.ma](https://www.orange.ma/)\n* Renseignez votre numéro de ligne puis cliquez sur « Continuer ».\n* Ensuite, saisissez votre mot de passe, le même que celui que vous avez défini lors de votre commande en ligne, avant d’appuyer sur le bouton « Me connecter ».\n* Renseignez les 13 chiffres figurants au dos de votre nouvelle carte SIM et cliquez sur « Activer ».\n* Vous recevrez un sms de confirmation d’activation sur votre nouvelle ligne.\n\nVotre ligne est activée !	[-0.021728516,-0.011779785,-0.005004883,-0.051757812,0.034179688,-0.024414062,0.036132812,0.032470703,0.016845703,0.01550293,-0.0007019043,0.008239746,0.0069274902,-0.0052490234,-0.043945312,0.068359375,-0.048583984,-0.012145996,0.033691406,0.08496094,-0.016845703,0.026367188,-0.01550293,0.041503906,0.045410156,-0.016479492,0.032470703,0.029418945,0,-0.010559082,0.012451172,-0.02355957,-0.037841797,0.00037384033,-0.013916016,-0.0066833496,-0.002822876,-0.043945312,0.0107421875,0.022949219,0.0038757324,-0.009155273,-0.003540039,0.017944336,-0.04248047,-0.016601562,-0.008483887,-0.00089263916,0.025756836,-0.0068359375,-0.007080078,-0.010498047,-0.04638672,0.003036499,0.052001953,-0.028808594,0.0546875,0.07373047,0.00029945374,0.026977539,-0.052246094,0.020019531,-0.03149414,-0.037841797,-0.012939453,-0.006164551,0.026123047,-0.043701172,-0.088378906,-0.04663086,0.013427734,0.0020141602,-0.0390625,0.02734375,-0.036621094,0.087890625,0.024047852,0.015014648,-0.011230469,0.016113281,0.05444336,-0.011230469,0.010009766,0.032958984,0.02368164,0.052001953,0.05078125,0.017333984,0.029418945,0.016479492,0.044433594,-0.0031433105,0.0050964355,0