7a700772-1727-42cc-902b-331e84ae35a3	# Business BOX (Fixe / 4G)\n## Je n’arrive pas à me connecter avec ma Business Box Fixe/4G\n### Je n’arrive pas à émettre des appels depuis mon numéro\n\nSi votre accès Internet fonctionne correctement, veuillez vérifier si votre appareil téléphonique est bien branché au niveau du port « i »\n\nSi le problème persiste, veuillez redémarrer votre BOX.\nLe cas échéant, il faudra prendre contact avec notre centre de relation entreprise aux numéros et horaires indiqués ci-dessous, pour faire les vérifications nécessaires :\n• 7/7J de 08H à 22H ;\n• Au 178 depuis une ligne Orange ;\n• Au 05 20 178 178 ou 06 63 178 178 depuis une autre ligne.	[-0.048339844,-0.05810547,-0.009460449,-0.05859375,0.026855469,-0.029418945,-0.00076293945,-0.021606445,0.004638672,-0.0023345947,-0.022705078,0.0024108887,-0.0019302368,-0.008117676,-0.025878906,0.06640625,-0.03125,-0.041748047,0.05908203,0.06640625,-0.012573242,0.0859375,-0.02709961,0.03857422,0.061523438,-0.002456665,-0.010925293,0.09082031,-0.010314941,-0.057617188,0.061767578,-0.048828125,0,-0.0049743652,-0.00023174286,-0.011169434,-0.024414062,-0.008300781,0.012084961,0.038330078,-0.003967285,0.016113281,-0.0070495605,0.015380859,-0.053222656,-0.020019531,-0.0033721924,-0.028198242,-0.033447266,-0.0024871826,0.03515625,0.05029297,-0.014953613,-0.0069274902,0.045898438,0.04248047,0.031982422,0.02331543,-0.0047912598,-0.014831543,-0.072753906,0.0032196045,-0.07714844,-0.04296875,-0.007537842,0.033935547,0.021118164,-0.05517578,-0.08642578,-0.009765625,-0.02355957,0.052978516,-0.022827148,-0.015991211,-0.0043945312,0.031982422,0.010131836,0.040039062,0.018676758,-0.014465332,-0.010131836,0.032470703,-0.022216797,0.009216309,-0.0047912598,0.007080078,0.040771484,7.534027e-05,0.053955078,0.026367188,0.05883789,-0.010192871,-0.044921875,-0.080078125,0.0087890625,-0.024047852,-0.020874023,0.051757812,-0.05419922,-0.05053711,0.012634277,-0.024169922,0.020874023,0.0045166016,-0.02722168,0.049072266,-0