571b0dd2-ad17-4a6b-adbf-02202ba5e3bc	# Business BOX (Fixe / 4G)\n## Je n’arrive pas à me connecter avec ma Business Box Fixe/4G\n### Je souhaite changer mon mot de passe WIFI / J’ai oublié mon mot de passe WIFI\n\n* J’accède à l’interface du routeur depuis un navigateur internet à l’adresse : 192.168.1.1 « Login : admin, mot de passe : admin sinon le mot de passe indiqué sur l’étiquette du routeur », puis, je suis le chemin : Configuration -WLAN - Paramètre WLAN de base -Clé WLAN\n* Je récupère le mot de passe wifi : Mot de passe disponible sur la case Clé WLAN « cocher la case afficher le mot de passe »\n* Je change le mot de passe : Cocher la case afficher le mot de passe, puis supprimer l’ancien mot de passe saisi sur la ligne Clé Wlan, ensuite saisir le nouveau mot de passe et appuyer sur appliquer.	[-0.031982422,-0.039794922,-0.0087890625,-0.091308594,0.057861328,-0.06201172,0.0077819824,0.014099121,-0.026000977,0.0071411133,0.010314941,0.0056762695,0.0020599365,-0.007385254,-0.022094727,0.076660156,0.043701172,-0.013061523,0.017456055,0.046875,0.00340271,0.0703125,0.032958984,0.030639648,0.037597656,-0.013183594,-0.023925781,0.06347656,-0.0107421875,-0.076660156,0.068847656,-0.060058594,0.003112793,-0.052978516,0.014221191,-0.0095825195,-0.0234375,0.0022277832,-0.013977051,0.017700195,0.0026550293,0.010437012,0.011291504,0.026000977,-0.038085938,-0.019165039,0.013122559,-0.0072631836,-0.03564453,-0.008605957,0.017700195,0.049316406,0.0005264282,-0.030761719,0.017211914,0.006286621,0.036132812,0.019165039,-0.004638672,-0.009155273,-0.09863281,0.011413574,-0.08251953,-0.034179688,0.0076904297,0.052490234,0.038330078,-0.044921875,-0.12011719,-0.017578125,-0.007232666,0.029663086,-0.038085938,-0.02319336,0.021118164,0.008300781,-0.022094727,0.049804688,0.032958984,-0.047851562,-0.0005836487,0.05419922,0.016845703,0.006439209,-0.03125,0.022705078,0.045654297,-0.0008163452,0.03491211,0.0026855469,0.041748047,-0.009094238,0.007507324,-0.03491211,0.014892578,-0.012451