5c01def1-7f50-427c-87e3-91b3e5020ce7	# Business Box Fibre\n## Je n’arrive pas à me connecter avec ma Business Box Fibre\n\nSi les voyants sont éteints :\n* Testez le routeur au niveau d’une autre prise murale et s’assurer que tous les ports liés au routeur sont connectés\n* Si le voyant est rouge :\n* Redémarrez le routeur en débranchant puis rebranchant le câble électrique.\n\nSi le problème persiste, il faudra prendre contact avec notre centre de relation entreprise aux numéros et horaires indiqués ci-dessous, pour faire les vérifications nécessaires :\n• 7/7J de 08H à 22H00 ;\n• Au 178 depuis une ligne Orange ;\n• Au 05 20 178 178 ou 06 63 178 178 depuis une autre ligne.	[-0.016601562,-0.013183594,-0.010437012,-0.068359375,0.057128906,0.010437012,-0.004119873,-0.030517578,-0.0025939941,-0.0058898926,0.005706787,-0.008728027,0.004638672,-0.008666992,-0.014526367,0.091796875,0.0024261475,-0.027954102,0.064941406,0.08935547,-0.040771484,0.025024414,-0.008850098,0.028930664,0.017456055,0.0065307617,-0.018188477,0.0625,-0.036376953,-0.071777344,0.04345703,-0.032714844,-0.014770508,-0.045654297,0.033935547,-0.012023926,-0.0014953613,-0.008056641,-0.0065307617,0.06298828,0.041992188,0.051757812,-0.026123047,0.033447266,-0.052490234,-0.01928711,0.033203125,-0.037841797,-0.032958984,0.020751953,0.04345703,0.02368164,-0.049072266,0.0008506775,0.00036239624,0.045654297,0.017089844,0.03515625,0.045654297,0.0107421875,-0.061767578,0.01159668,-0.072753906,-0.061767578,0.010070801,0.040283203,0,-0.0546875,-0.076171875,-0.027832031,0.029052734,0.07080078,-0.036621094,0.018676758,-0.037109375,0.072753906,0.01184082,0.056152344,0.025634766,-0.021728516,-0.024291992,0.01928711,-0.032714844,0.012634277,0.0027618408,-0.00048828125,0.044189453,-0.0046081543,0.048095703,0.02319336,0.06542969,-0.023071289,0.0016174316,-0.09716797,0.012634277,-0.01977539,0.0053710938,0.07128906,-0.068847656,-0.045166016,-0.0054626465,0.006866455,0.038330078,0.007171631,-0.05444336,0.03515625,-0.03930664,