5bf99841-7acb-4ff0-8bce-3b5fd3e039b4	# Business Box Fibre\n## Je n’arrive pas à me connecter avec ma Business Box Fibre\n### Je n’arrive pas à émettre des appels depuis mon numéro\n\nSi votre accès Internet fonctionne correctement, veuillez vérifier si votre appareil téléphonique est bien branché au niveau du port « Phone 1 »\n\nSi le problème persiste, veuillez redémarrer votre BOX.Le cas échéant, il faudra prendre contact avec notre centre de relation entreprise aux numéros et horaires indiqués ci-dessous, pour faire les vérifications nécessaires :\n• 7/7J de 08H à 22H00 ;\n• Au 178 depuis une ligne Orange ;\n• Au 05 20 178 178 ou 06 63 178 178 depuis une autre ligne.	[-0.04345703,-0.029418945,-0.009643555,-0.07324219,0.038330078,-0.008483887,-0.0004348755,-0.024291992,0.008361816,-0.002105713,-0.007446289,-0.015625,0.0072021484,-0.007446289,-0.019042969,0.053710938,-0.02722168,-0.022949219,0.06933594,0.067871094,-0.037353516,0.06982422,-0.015380859,0.049804688,0.034179688,-0.008361816,-0.01361084,0.08300781,-0.015625,-0.06738281,0.060058594,-0.064453125,0.0027008057,-0.016479492,-0.0048828125,-0.010314941,-0.008422852,-0.008239746,0.022705078,0.06542969,0.017333984,0.03466797,-0.021728516,0.02355957,-0.05810547,-0.029541016,0.0008735657,-0.037597656,-0.02709961,0.026855469,0.04321289,0.035888672,-0.041992188,-0.0066223145,0.019042969,0.05029297,0.029174805,0.036132812,0.032958984,0.013122559,-0.060058594,0.006072998,-0.06298828,-0.045166016,-0.002822876,0.029296875,0.0059814453,-0.06591797,-0.07714844,-0.00970459,0.0043945312,0.046875,-0.025390625,-0.005859375,-0.018798828,0.07324219,0.022094727,0.061523438,0.024169922,-0.0071411133,-0.020996094,0.012756348,-0.033447266,-0.00049209595,0.008056641,0.0035552979,0.04663086,0.0050964355,0.059814453,0.02319336,0.057617188,-0.015014648,-0.03564453,-0.08154297,0.008056641,-0.015563965,-0.0054016113,0.08496094,-0.053222656,-0.033691406,0.009155273,0.0022277832,0.016723633,0.037597656,-0.048583984,0.036621094,-0.030395508