d0bda84d-ff93-46da-96ca-d46e51d6e2cf	# Business Box Fibre\n## Je n’arrive pas à me connecter avec ma Business Box Fibre\n### Je souhaite changer mon mot de passe WIFI / J’ai oublié mon mot de passe WIFI\n\n* J’accède à l’interface du routeur depuis un navigateur internet à l’adresse : 192.168.11.1 « Login, mot de passe indiqués sur l’étiquette du routeur », puis, je suis le chemin : Réseau local – WLAN – WLAN Basic – Configuration du WLAN SSID –SSID1 (2.4ghz) ou SSID2 (5ghz).\n* Je récupère le mot de passe wifi : Mot de passe disponible sur la case « phrase secrète WPA » - cocher la case afficher le mot de passe\n* Je change le mot de passe : Cocher la case afficher le mot de passe, puis supprimer l’ancien mot de passe saisi sur la ligne « phrase secrète WPA » , ensuite saisir le nouveau mot de passe et appuyer sur appliquer.	[-0.032470703,0.0026397705,-0.008361816,-0.095703125,0.067871094,-0.040771484,0.011779785,0.01171875,-0.04345703,0.0064697266,0.028564453,-0.011230469,0.004058838,-0.006286621,-0.018920898,0.06933594,0.045166016,0.0074768066,0.01550293,0.036865234,-0.0087890625,0.061035156,0.032958984,0.046875,0.015197754,-0.018676758,-0.017944336,0.061523438,-0.008911133,-0.07470703,0.059814453,-0.07421875,0.009216309,-0.068359375,0.007873535,-0.0076293945,-0.014770508,-0.0050964355,0.0020599365,0.043701172,0.017089844,0.028808594,-0.0079956055,0.049560547,-0.041748047,-0.035888672,0.027832031,-0.01574707,-0.0234375,0.015197754,0.024291992,0.03564453,-0.02355957,-0.03955078,-0.004425049,0.010803223,0.05029297,0.03125,0.018676758,0.023925781,-0.08203125,0.011413574,-0.06225586,-0.021728516,0.013916016,0.055908203,0.01977539,-0.042236328,-0.12109375,-0.025512695,0.016601562,0.03930664,-0.03930664,-0.010131836,0.010009766,0.038330078,-0.021850586,0.07470703,0.033447266,-0.033935547,0.0028381348,0.033447266,0.006500244,0.0033416748,-0.026489258,0.027709961,0.04711914,0.000869751,0.03564453,-0.0005340576,0.03149414,-0.00793457,0.021850586,-0.037841797,0.0070495605,