3775434c-e55d-49ff-9da3-40a36767dfe9	# Business Box Fibre\n## Je n’arrive pas à me connecter avec ma Business Box Fibre\n### 1 - L’emplacement du routeur\n\nLa position du routeur dans votre logement est essentielle pour optimiser le débit et la portée du Wifi. Par conséquent, ne placez pas le routeur dans une armoire, ne le mettez pas non directement sur le sol ou entre des livres, ou encore sur des haut-parleurs ou d'autres appareils électriques. Idéalement il doit être situé sur une étagère à environ 1,2 mètre du sol.\nBon à savoir : Si votre logement est grand et que la portée du Wifi n’est pas suffisante, Orange vous propose deux types d’équipement (répéteur et CPL) qui permettent d’améliorer la portée de votre wifi, que vous pouvez trouver sur notre boutique en ligne ou en agence.	[-0.018432617,-0.0115356445,-0.008972168,-0.064941406,0.049072266,0.007446289,0.052978516,-0.024414062,-0.0034484863,0.030639648,0.08300781,0.027954102,-0.013916016,-0.0073242188,-0.020141602,0.083496094,0.015380859,-0.031982422,0.0024108887,0.053955078,-0.068847656,0.06933594,0.013122559,0.06933594,-0.0087890625,0.013122559,-0.022338867,0.012817383,-0.033691406,-0.115722656,0.036132812,-0.001045227,-0.04296875,-0.012084961,0.0047912598,-0.008911133,0.013549805,-0.012634277,-0.018554688,0.079589844,0.024780273,0.021118164,-0.040771484,0.048583984,-0.053710938,-0.050048828,-0.015563965,-0.011169434,-0.04345703,0.025512695,0.07128906,0.010375977,-0.034423828,-0.026489258,-0.020141602,-0.045654297,0.016113281,0.040771484,0.041259766,0.008483887,-0.080078125,0.004058838,-0.09082031,-0.03491211,0.03112793,0.029418945,0.014709473,-0.063964844,-0.08154297,0.0043945312,0.017089844,0.061523438,-0.018920898,0.0049743652,-0.00041007996,0.051513672,0.021484375,0.06225586,0.033691406,0.012817383,0.0107421875,0.007080078,-0.011474609,0.002456665,-0.017089844,0.001876831,0.059570312,0.004638672,0.028564453,0.030639648,0.068847656,-0.004058838,0.052246094,-0.05419922,0.005065918,-0.013183594,-0.0076