f22743be-e790-4c23-a0eb-15c9af289a2b	# Business Box Fibre\n## Je n’arrive pas à me connecter avec ma Business Box Fibre\n### 2 - Les obstacles dégradent le Wifi\n\nLes murs, les aquariums et poteaux peuvent perturber le signal Wifi, ce qui nuit à la vitesse et à la qualité d’utilisation d’internet. Pour éviter les problèmes de connexion, utilisez un répéteur ou un CPL qui étend la portée Wifi à n’importe quel endroit de votre domicile et garantit une connexion rapide au réseau. Si votre routeur est coincé entre deux obstacles (par exemple entre une cheminée et une armoire) déplacez-le. Quelques centimètres peuvent faire la différence.\nBon à savoir : si vous avez un équipement qui télécharge beaucoup, rapprochez-le du routeur ou connectez-le par câble Ethernet si possible. C’est l’ensemble de votre réseau Wifi que vous allez soulager.	[-0.015625,-0.020385742,-0.009094238,-0.032470703,0.07373047,0.0038452148,0.026000977,-0.032226562,-0.023803711,0.03930664,0.08154297,-0.00970459,-0.045166016,-0.006500244,-0.018798828,0.091796875,0.036132812,-0.071777344,-0.0015335083,0.030273438,-0.033447266,0.072753906,-0.010559082,0.087402344,-0.0034484863,0.0018539429,-0.0013504028,0.022949219,-0.03930664,-0.08300781,0.012329102,-0.021728516,-0.007232666,-0.029541016,0.01953125,-0.008483887,0.044433594,-0.0076293945,-0.022583008,0.07324219,0.04345703,0.030273438,0.010070801,0.021606445,-0.03149414,-0.052978516,0.020996094,-0.000541687,-0.041992188,0.030761719,0.08300781,0.040039062,-0.033203125,-0.0009918213,-0.016601562,0.0053710938,0.018066406,0.021484375,0.038085938,0.025756836,-0.045654297,-0.03564453,-0.100097656,-0.020996094,0.02331543,0.016235352,0.016113281,-0.04345703,-0.083496094,-0.022583008,0.004760742,0.06298828,-0.009277344,-0.018798828,0.008666992,0.03466797,-0.009033203,0.052978516,0.02734375,0.0134887695,-0.0023040771,0.028076172,0.025024414,0.0013046265,0.0019683838,-0.00970459,0.041748047,-0.010192871,0.04736328,0.028808594,0.007446289,0.018798828,0.022216797,-0