246b2935-4d2e-4105-ae1f-3bdd93353dfd	# Business Box Fibre\n## Je n’arrive pas à me connecter avec ma Business Box Fibre\n### 5 - Le signal doit être sécurisé\n\nCela peut sembler évident, mais ça mérite d’être dit : votre Wifi doit être sécurisé, ce qui signifie qu’il est important de définir un mot de passe difficile à déchiffrer.\nBon à savoir : N’hésitez pas à utiliser de lettres, chiffres et caractères spéciaux pour votre mot de passe. S’il est trop compliqué à retenir, pas de panique. Vous pouvez connecter vos appareils directement grâce au bouton WPS situé sur le routeur.	[-0.029052734,-0.03930664,-0.0064697266,-0.04345703,0.056640625,-0.056640625,0.017578125,0.021240234,-0.029418945,0.0013504028,0.043945312,-0.0079956055,0.0012130737,-0.0049438477,-0.03149414,0.06640625,0.040039062,-0.05029297,0.007171631,0.020385742,-0.032470703,0.076660156,0.005004883,0.08496094,-0.0050354004,-0.022460938,-0.029296875,0.038330078,-0.0025024414,-0.06542969,0.022460938,-0.053710938,0.01574707,-0.040039062,0.0071105957,-0.006652832,0.03112793,0.02709961,-0.00075531006,0.0625,-0.0074768066,0.025024414,-0.008483887,0.056396484,0.003326416,-0.059814453,0.0146484375,-0.01977539,-0.015258789,0.053466797,0.04345703,0.01940918,-0.017456055,-0.013122559,-0.0041503906,0.0023345947,0.043945312,0.032714844,0.010986328,0.015258789,-0.10205078,-0.004638672,-0.08251953,-0.0119018555,-0.017333984,0.06591797,0.015014648,-0.053955078,-0.11035156,-0.011657715,0.026611328,0.06298828,-0.017578125,-0.016601562,0.003250122,0.05834961,-0.012939453,0.08496094,0.032470703,0.00491333,-0.008544922,0.021362305,-0.0030670166,-0.017700195,-0.014465332,0.008483887,0.068359375,0.017700195,0.007019043,0.048339844,0.045410156,0.006378174,0.040283203,-0.034179688,0.012084961,-0.028076172,-0.017333984,0.09033203,-0.030639648,-0.013061523,-0.0014801025,-0.00075531006,0.057861328,0.004058838,-0.047851562,0.028808594,-0.03515625,-0.010253906,-0.037353516,-0.0703125,0.033447266,0.0077819824,-0.036621094,0.03955078,-