64046701-577c-4bb6-a012-e3b845c6c4c3	# Business Box Fibre\n## Je n’arrive pas à me connecter avec ma Business Box Fibre\n### 6 - Le routeur doit être redémarré\n\nLe redémarrage du routeur vous permet de nettoyer sa mémoire. Il est préférable de redémarrer l'appareil en l'éteignant pendant environ 10 secondes, puis en le rallumant après ce délai.\nBon à savoir : Attention, ne confondez pas ce redémarrage avec la réinitialisation de l'appareil. Réinitialiser en appuyant sur reset va restaurer les paramètres d'usine du routeur et annulera le mot de passe que vous avez défini.	[-0.020019531,0.012390137,-0.009399414,-0.07470703,0.068359375,0.0041503906,0.008911133,-0.0138549805,-0.056640625,0.045654297,-0.026367188,-0.011047363,-0.011291504,-0.007659912,-0.011291504,0.07324219,0.035888672,-0.016601562,0.041992188,0.08203125,0.020385742,0.030395508,0.008666992,0.029418945,0.038085938,-0.01373291,-0.027832031,0.04321289,-0.03564453,-0.103027344,0.012268066,-0.016113281,-0.037109375,-0.06347656,0.007293701,-0.012390137,-0.021728516,-0.02709961,-0.006866455,0.028686523,0.035888672,0.046142578,0.0059509277,0.025024414,-0.021728516,0.008666992,0.037841797,-0.038085938,-0.0053710938,0.022583008,0.0390625,0.055908203,-0.011962891,-0.015625,0.001663208,0.024414062,-0.016113281,0.040527344,0.034179688,0.018310547,-0.05493164,0.020019531,-0.0859375,-0.034423828,0.006378174,0.032470703,-0.0021972656,-0.06591797,-0.06689453,-0.00491333,0.024047852,0.014770508,-0.022338867,0.0035705566,-0.016235352,0.033691406,0.008483887,0.047851562,0.032470703,0.009216309,-0.03466797,-0.0013198853,0.0027770996,0.025756836,0.041748047,0.021606445,0.033935547,0.003250122,0.02368164,0.022338867,0.027709961,0.026245117,0.03149414,-0.023925781,-0.023071289,-0.010498047,-0.012023926,0.07763672,-0.060302734,-0.041748047,-0.020874023,0.022705078,-0.01373291,-0.008605957,-0.048095703,0.013122559,-0.030029297,-0.0022277832,0.028442383,-0.056640625,0.010009766,0.009277344,-0.03881836,0.04638672,-0.036376953,0