b4405f77-4ff0-449a-a303-2f3ef9648658	# Business Box Fibre\n## Je n’arrive pas à me connecter avec ma Business Box Fibre\n### 7 - La qualité du Wifi dépend des appareils\n\nLa vitesse de la connexion sans fil est considérablement affectée par l'équipement que vous utilisez. Il est important que vos appareils (smartphones, tablettes,…) prennent en charge la bande de 5 GHz. D’autres paramètres comme le nombre d’antennes externes et internes, ainsi que la mémoire et le processeur utilisés peuvent également impacter la qualité du Wifi. Des équipements trop âgés peuvent ralentir l’ensemble de votre réseau Wifi. Des équipements d’entrée de gamme peuvent être limités en performance.\nBon à savoir : Pour tester correctement votre débit, rien de mieux qu’une connexion par câble Ethernet directement sur le routeur et un test depuis un ordinateur.	[-0.038330078,-0.05834961,-0.007598877,-0.033447266,0.05029297,0.029296875,0.0703125,-0.020874023,-0.03149414,0.005340576,0.06298828,0.018188477,-0.03173828,-0.005218506,-0.02758789,0.052978516,0.016967773,-0.05859375,-0.015258789,0.03100586,-0.041503906,0.08300781,-0.02331543,0.095214844,-0.015075684,-0.011108398,0,0.04272461,-0.032470703,-0.092285156,-0.0012664795,-0.011779785,-0.018920898,-0.0049743652,0.04248047,-0.0069274902,0.04321289,0.03466797,-0.010192871,0.05444336,-0.003753662,0.05444336,-0.028442383,0.039794922,0.0075683594,-0.100097656,0.010681152,-0.017700195,-0.03564453,0.017944336,0.07128906,0.02368164,-0.04321289,-0.009765625,-0.03540039,0.03515625,0.029296875,0.017944336,0.026977539,0.0028839111,-0.079589844,0.0015258789,-0.059814453,-0.03857422,-0.0020446777,0.03857422,0.029541016,-0.03149414,-0.08935547,-0.025268555,0.022216797,0.01574707,-0.012878418,-0.018188477,0.0058288574,0.06542969,0.027709961,0.04296875,0.026733398,0.005706787,0.0037841797,0.04296875,-0.0069274902,0.00289917,-0.00579834,0.0057678223,0.034423828,-0.011230469,0.01965332,0.037353516,0.012084961,0.0023345947,0.0012359619,-0.07128906,-0.0390625,-