073a7c41-b96d-417b-8b63-4cd2e248d558	# Mobile\n## Pourquoi Internet ne marche pas sur mon mobile ou tablette ?\n\n1. Avez-vous changé de terminal ? Si OUI, veuillez cliquer sur le lien suivant pour la configuration de votre nouveau terminal ([https://configuration-mobile.orange.ma/](http://configuration-mobile.orange.ma/orange-fo/)\n2. Avez-vous testé la navigation sur un ou plusieurs sites web? Avez-vous testé la connexion sur plusieurs applications (Facebook, WhatsApp...)? Si le problème ne concerne qu’un seul site web ou une seule application, l’incident n’est pas lié directement à Orange.\n3. Le problème est-il lié à un lieu en particulier ou pas ? S’il est lié à un lieu en particulier, il s’agit d’un problème de couverture dans cette zone.\n4. Avez-vous changé de terminal ? Si OUI, veuillez cliquer sur le lien suivant pour la configuration de votre nouveau terminal ([https://configuration-mobile.orange.ma/](http://configuration-mobile.orange.ma/orange-fo/))	[-0.016967773,-0.018798828,-0.0065307617,-0.049560547,0.09667969,0.0015640259,0.091308594,0.022216797,-0.05834961,0.009155273,0.060546875,-0.00680542,-0.025634766,-0.005554199,-0.042236328,0.056396484,-0.0059509277,-0.018920898,0.024169922,0.044921875,0.011779785,0.040527344,0.041503906,0.09472656,0.022094727,-0.00491333,-0.020141602,0.04736328,-0.033935547,-0.049560547,0.0035095215,0.0001206398,-0.012878418,-0.007293701,0.027709961,-0.00680542,0.013977051,-0.03540039,-0.001914978,0.028564453,-0.00033187866,-0.009643555,0.06591797,0.014953613,-0.018676758,-0.022460938,0.052001953,-0.0095825195,-0.019165039,0.040771484,-0.0013198853,0.029296875,-0.064453125,0.0034637451,0.021606445,-0.026000977,0.047607422,0.041015625,0.045654297,0.0033111572,-0.060546875,-0.001411438,-0.0154418945,-0.004211426,-0.005340576,0.0037078857,0.038330078,-0.06982422,-0.056884766,-0.060302734,0.02319336,0.05517578,-0.018432617,-0.0056762695,-0.032714844,0.06982422,0.034423828,0.012023926,0.0047302246,-0.026000977,0.016967773,0.03173