9521d037-2fd3-4fa5-af0d-9617dc3bb5ec	# Business Hosting\n## Gestes de proximité\n\nBénéficiez de l’accompagnement personnalisé de nos équipes techniques sur site 24h/24 et 7jours/7 pour assurer le bon déroulement de l’ensemble de vos interventions, depuis l’installation jusqu’au reporting :\n* Contrôle et supervision de vos actifs à la demande\n* Gestion de vos stock sur site (réception du matériel, état du stock…)\n* Mise à disposition de reporting pointus grâce à des outils de gestion (DCIM) de référence internationale\n* Coordination et gestion des interventions spécifiques sur site\n* Configuration et câblage (arrêt/relance d’un serveur, changement de carte, vérification de câblage…)	[0.017578125,-0.06982422,-0.007293701,-0.07080078,0.053222656,-0.064453125,0.034423828,-0.033935547,0.03930664,0.0076904297,0.06225586,-0.001121521,-0.017700195,-0.006958008,-0.01953125,0.12597656,-0.021972656,-0.0052490234,-0.05908203,0.038330078,-0.015197754,0.034179688,-0.05053711,0.083984375,-0.020141602,-0.0126953125,0.042236328,0.055664062,-0.020385742,0.009338379,0.052246094,0.0049438477,-0.0040283203,0.016357422,0.055664062,-0.009887695,-0.053222656,-0.034179688,-0.018066406,0.03466797,0.010253906,0.052246094,0.06640625,0.001411438,0.0032653809,-0.061035156,-0.042236328,-0.013305664,-0.040283203,-0.010925293,0.028930664,0.053955078,0.007080078,0.008850098,0.00012683868,0.03540039,0.0050964355,0.0018005371,0.041015625,0.01586914,-0.037841797,0.01574707,-0.095214844,-0.017333984,0.01574707,0.0025177002,-0.0075683594,-0.05053711,-0.026123047,-0.0078125,-0.0005187988,0.015014648,0.015014648,0.0703125,0.009399414,0.042236328,-0.013122559,0.067871094,0.028564453,0.016357422,-0.014404297,0.0075683594,0.024658203,0.017944336,-0.0010070801,0.048339844,0.0015029907,-0.04272461,0.016845703,-0.041259766,0.03149414,-0.0146484375,-0.009521484,-0.041015625,-0.010559082,0.003753662,0.013061523,0.029052734,-0.016845703,-0.016479492,0.025268555,-0.007751465,0.009338379,0.002380371,-0.04394531