ae022642-1153-4b95-a9d1-ccb1ed0cc37e	# Microsoft Azure\n## En savoir plus\n### Pourquoi utiliser le cloud computing plutôt que de se contenter d’une infrastructure locale ?\n\nLe cloud computing permet aux organisations d’innover plus rapidement, et offre des ressources flexibles ainsi qu’une meilleure résilience par rapport aux ressources locales. Avec les services cloud, vous ne payez généralement que ce dont vous avez besoin et au moment où vous en avez besoin. Le cloud computing peut fonctionner avec l’infrastructure locale existante (dans un modèle hybride) ou la remplacer complètement. En savoir plus sur cloud computing et migration cloud computing.	[-0.032958984,-0.05053711,-0.00390625,-0.045898438,0.08300781,-0.0053710938,-0.020629883,-0.07714844,-0.03100586,0.033203125,0.026855469,0.06933594,-0.03466797,-0.003112793,-0.030883789,0.053222656,-0.034179688,-0.001083374,-0.044921875,0.00793457,-0.026367188,0.028686523,-0.021240234,0.08496094,-0.059326172,0.0061950684,0.041015625,0.03112793,-0.067871094,-0.017333984,-0.006225586,0.019042969,-0.0035705566,-0.029174805,0.008666992,-0.006866455,0.0017852783,0.012207031,-0.01928711,-0.021728516,0.015380859,-0.030761719,0.05126953,0.014526367,-0.051513672,-0.036621094,0.0068359375,-0.08251953,0.027709961,-0.011047363,-0.014160156,0.023925781,-0.026123047,-0.008239746,-0.005279541,0.028442383,-0.0024108887,0.022094727,-0.029907227,-0.0013504028,0.009399414,0.052001953,-0.043945312,0.015014648,0.028808594,0.045654297,-0.009277344,-0.01373291,0.0095825195,-0.035888672,0.0027618408,-0.03149414,0.005584717,0.010437012,0.0020599365,0.033447266,0.031982422,0.004638672,0.03173828,0.0065307617,-0.056152344,-0.010437012,0.016235352,0.024169922,0.025024414,0.037841797,0.04345703,3.0517578e-05,0.03515625,-0.03540039,0.032470703,0.039794922,-0.053466797,0.045898438,-0.029174805,-0.008666992,0.0058898926,-0.064453125,0.00037956238,-0.0028076172,0.047851562,-0.013366699,0.06347656,-0.031982422,0.012268066,0.0014266968,-0.061523438,