c31a27dc-4b77-4ab3-89af-3e4771f944b6	# Microsoft Azure\n## En savoir plus\n### Quels sont les avantages de la plateforme Azure ?\n\n* Intégration avec d'autres services Microsoft : Azure s'intègre facilement avec des outils Microsoft comme Office 365 et Dynamics, facilitant ainsi la collaboration.\n* Analyse de données avancée : Azure dispose de puissants outils d'analyse et de visualisation des données, permettant aux entreprises de tirer des insights précieux de leurs données.	[-0.013183594,-0.05029297,-0.0063171387,-0.075683594,0.06640625,0.03173828,-0.020263672,-0.023803711,-0.011108398,-0.047607422,0.009277344,0.06933594,-0.011047363,-0.0069274902,-0.029174805,0.067871094,-0.11279297,0.044433594,-0.03540039,-0.013000488,-0.016967773,0.033935547,-0.09082031,0.080078125,-0.099609375,-0.05883789,0.017578125,0.018920898,-0.024414062,-0.0046081543,-0.002319336,-0.03515625,0.012817383,0.01550293,0.046875,-0.009643555,-0.025634766,-0.013977051,-0.032226562,0.0099487305,0.03149414,0.05444336,0.025268555,0.02734375,0.034423828,-0.043701172,0.050048828,-0.03857422,-0.009399414,0.025146484,-0.004119873,0.023925781,0.008483887,-0.021850586,-0.004760742,0.00340271,0.014343262,0.03125,-0.009155273,0.015563965,-0.07421875,0.046875,-0.05444336,0.0115356445,0.03466797,0.040039062,-0.04321289,-0.0033111572,0.0040283203,-0.01574707,-0.002609253,-0.020507812,0.013366699,-0.01928711,-0.022216797,0.01171875,0.05029297,0.05444336,0.029174805,0.020019531,-0.049804688,0.037841797,0.010925293,0.03491211,0.02746582,0.0019378662,0.006652832,-0.018798828,0.06298828,-0.032714844,0.037597656,0.048583984,-0.071777344,0.06591797,-0.039794922,-0.014343262,0.012451172,-0.0703125,-0.021850586,-0.023071289,0.036376953,-0.025146484,0.045410156,-0.006866455,0.00078964233,0.044189453,-0.02355957,-0.008911133,-0.060058594,-0.04248047,-0.028442383,-0.004211426,-0.06347656,0.028320312,-0.043701172,0.055908203,-0.0024871826,-0.016113281,-0.022583008,0.022216797,-0.05493164,-0.047851562,0.005645752,-0.006