a066ce15-d9ad-4d64-bf68-393839d497ca	# Configurer internet\n## Configurer internet sur Android\n### Configurer internet sur iOS\n\nPour un téléchargement optimal, veuillez disposer d’une connexion internet stable.\nTéléchargez le profil attaché:\n[MobileConfigFile](https://www.orange.ma/content/download/184431/2954361/version/1/file/MobileConfigFile.orange.ma.mobileconfig)\nCliquez sur la flèche, cliquez sur « Enregistrer dans le compte » :\n\nCopiez le lien et collez-le dans le navigateur web de votre téléphone :\n\nOuvrez-le, cliquez sur « télécharger quand même » :\n\nCliquez sur « Autoriser », cliquez sur « Fermer » :\n\nAllez dans Réglages → Profil téléchargé, cliquez sur « Installer »\n\nSaisissez votre code personnel de verrouillage :\n\nCliquez sur « Installer », cliquez sur « OK » :\n\nActivez le mode avion et désactivez-le. Ensuite désactivez le wifi et assurez-vous bien que votre connexion soit maintenant en 4G et fonctionne correctement.\n1	[-0.040527344,-0.024658203,-0.009216309,-0.075683594,0.072753906,-0.06347656,0.075683594,0.06298828,-0.067871094,0.016479492,0.06201172,0.04711914,-0.05078125,-0.0071105957,-0.044433594,0.02758789,-0.004638672,0.009887695,-0.009033203,0.06591797,-0.0011978149,0.095703125,-0.0078125,0.051757812,0.016235352,-0.047607422,-0.020141602,0.044433594,-0.048095703,-0.0625,-0.013977051,-0.020629883,0.0040283203,-0.0052490234,0.008728027,-0.009521484,0.0043945312,-0.04736328,0.009887695,0.055664062,-0.04736328,-0.033447266,0.03564453,0.03515625,-0.026611328,-0.02331543,0.009338379,-0.010986328,-0.03149414,0.01928711,0.028564453,0.059326172,-0.0054626465,-0.032714844,0.052490234,-0.019042969,0.041259766,0.0625,0.00793457,0.025024414,-0.09863281,0.00982666,-0.011779785,0.016235352,-0.016479492,0.018432617,0.05444336,-0.034423828,-0.05859375,-0.022460938,0.0035705566,0.017333984,-0.021972656,-0.018920898,-0.0024719238,0.060791016,-0.0046691895,-0.0057678223,0.032226562,-0.020141602,0.032958984,-0.008972168,-0.005554199,-0.016845703