b7493c6f-cb99-4b0f-8eea-592d4cc4a1cf	# Dual Play\n\n* [Dual Play](https://entreprise.orange.ma/Solutions-Business/Fixe/Internet-Haut-Debit/Dual-Play#address-273fcd2ee06e51564ba80f7ca200d4b5)\n* [Avantages](https://entreprise.orange.ma/Solutions-Business/Fixe/Internet-Haut-Debit/Dual-Play#address-d8a96334ccf566bd85e619c3b9efc012)\n\nDual Play AvantagesDual Play\n[Je suis intéressé](https://www.orange.ma/Quiz/Formulaire-Prise-d-interet)\nEn optant pour la solution Dual Play, vous gagnez en performance en vous équipant d’un package complet qui comprend une solution internet haut débit et une solution voix fixe en option.\nLe haut débit symétrique, jusqu’à 20 fois plus rapide qu’une connexion asymétrique ADSL, va vous permettre de partager vos données avec vos collaborateurs et partenaires sans risques d’interruption.	[0.018676758,-0.07421875,-0.012084961,-0.041992188,0.08300781,0.009338379,-0.012084961,-0.028930664,-0.014526367,-0.012268066,0.0025177002,0.057861328,-0.0087890625,-0.011230469,-0.03930664,0.06298828,-0.026000977,0.007080078,-0.022949219,0.072265625,-0.036376953,0.05078125,-0.05810547,0.100097656,0.014709473,0.0026245117,0.0138549805,-0.030273438,0.0032043457,-0.038330078,-0.024169922,-0.042236328,-0.01171875,-0.0030670166,0.01586914,-0.014343262,-0.014282227,-0.02319336,0.002670288,0.037597656,0.063964844,-0.028076172,-0.023925781,0.022583008,-0.051757812,-0.025634766,0.072265625,0.02368164,0.0073547363,0.026000977,0.040283203,0.015197754,-0.043701172,0.0007972717,0.026977539,0.0032348633,0.026000977,0.08154297,0.025512695,-0.01159668,-0.09814453,0.006591797,-0.043701172,0.01965332,-0.004425049,0.046875,0.019042969,-0.021972656,-0.021972656,-0.080566406,0.022583008,-0.01361084,-0.021118164,0.006164551,-0.014282227,0.060058594,0.0032958984,0.016357422,-0.0078125,0.032470703,-0.010375977,0.00031280518,-0.034423828,0.01965332,-0.015258789,0.041748047,0.01965332,-0.04272461,0.011291504,-0.00289917,0.05444336,0.03564453,-0.059570312,-0.042236328,-0.026855469,