24b4f63a-5351-4acc-b257-1cef18662ab6	# Machine-to-Machine\n\n[Je suis intéressé](https://www.orange.ma/Quiz/Formulaire-Prise-d-interet)\nGrâce aux solutions machine-to-machine, des millions d’équipements sont aujourd’hui connectés à travers le monde, permettant la digitalisation de plusieurs opérations métiers, dans différents secteurs d’activité.\nPour faciliter la gestion de ces millions de cartes SIM Machine-to-Machine, Orange met à la disposition de ces clients une offre Machine-to Machine complète :\n1. Les forfaits Machine-to-Machine : en fonction de vos besoins métiers (Internet, SMS, voix, national/Roaming…), nous vous proposons une large gamme de forfaits Machine-to-Machine adaptés à vos usages.\n2. Ce portail vous permet de garder le contrôle sur l’ensemble de vos cartes SMS Machine-to-Machine en quelques clics, n’importe où, à n’importe quel moment, et surtout en toute autonomie.	[-0.04248047,-0.02734375,-0.008728027,-0.115234375,0.016235352,-0.017822266,0.06542969,0.0049438477,0.019042969,-0.015136719,-0.04321289,-0.018676758,0.01361084,-0.009216309,-0.044189453,0.0859375,-0.075683594,0.010498047,-0.016723633,0.060302734,0.0013504028,0.022094727,-0.046142578,0.09472656,-0.0017318726,-0.0016021729,0.029052734,0.006225586,-0.03564453,-0.010681152,0.026977539,0.0037841797,-0.02709961,-0.03149414,-0.006072998,-0.0115356445,0.027954102,-0.017211914,-0.021240234,0.031982422,-0.004760742,0.032226562,-0.028930664,0.021240234,-0.005554199,-0.053222656,0.038330078,-0.026245117,-0.034423828,-0.019897461,0.027954102,-0.014526367,-0.04248047,-0.000957489,0.052001953,0.015258789,0.06298828,0.045410156,0.005340576,-0.004547119,-0.06225586,0.0034942627,-0.09765625,0.0036773682,0.012512207,0.036865234,0.057861328,-0.07128906,-0.055908203,-0.0075683594,-0.014404297,-0.013000488,-0.040283203,-0.0107421875,-0.049804688,0.057617188,0.040527344,0.016113281,0.029907227,0.034179688,0.02722168,0.041503906,0.029907227,0.02722168,0.013977051,0.049316406,0.024414062,0.0051574707,0.