8ed25388-e8b8-44a3-b496-2334a0ab7713	# Business Box Fibre\n## La Fibre selon Orange\n### Pourquoi choisir Orange ?\n\nEn choisissant Orange, vous faites confiance à l’un des plus grands opérateur mondiaux et à une entreprise toujours en quête d’innovation. Profitez d’une connexion performante 100% fibre, d’un service de qualité et d’un matériel à la pointe de la technologie.\nLa Box révolutionne internet dans votre entreprise grâce à sa transmission de débit très puissante et son Wi-Fi plus efficace que jamais.	[-0.016357422,-0.024780273,-0.009460449,-0.044189453,0.043701172,0.0016479492,0.010253906,-0.020019531,0.02331543,0.0012893677,0.006286621,0.033691406,0.0019226074,-0.007537842,-0.033447266,0.053710938,-0.055664062,0.026733398,-0.010559082,0.09082031,-0.0703125,0.055908203,0.025390625,0.07519531,-0.009033203,-0.017822266,-0.020751953,0.016357422,-0.041503906,-0.08203125,-0.0042419434,-0.06542969,-0.028076172,-0.018188477,0.029174805,-0.009460449,0.049316406,0.026611328,-0.017944336,0.111816406,0.036376953,0.022827148,-0.068359375,0.049072266,-0.06591797,-0.06225586,0.03149414,-0.023803711,0.0033416748,0.0017547607,0.06738281,-0.0011138916,-0.07324219,0.013916016,-0.003326416,0.011047363,0.023803711,0.07373047,0.03125,0.030395508,-0.057373047,0.008544922,-0.061035156,-0.029296875,0.0078125,0.0546875,0.024536133,-0.03955078,-0.03881836,-0.018432617,0.020874023,0.026611328,-0.026000977,0.023071289,-0.017089844,0.08300781,0.030517578,0.026000977,0.0095825195,0.0071411133,0.00046348572,0.013671875,-0.02722168,0.0074157715,0.0073242188,0.018676758,0.053710938,-0.018188477,-0.01940918,0.021850586,0.048095703,0.0057678223,0.014831543,-0.031982422,0.0015258789,-0.025146484,-0.0024719238,0.084472656,-0.07763672,-0.012878418,0.010620117,-0.0011291504,0.033447266,0.064453125,-0.056884766,0.041503906,-0.059814453,0.022705078,0.0063171387,-0.0703125,0.0033111572,-0.027954102,-0.043701172,-0.019897461,-0.03857422,0.021850586,0.02722168,-0.017456055,0.028076172,-0.01586914,0