86901d5b-c339-4f85-a9c7-f41bcbd85cf4	# Business Box Fibre\n## En savoir plus\n### Quel débit est offert dans le cadre de cette offre, s’agit-il d’un débit garanti ?\n\nLe débit de téléchargement démarre à 20 Mbps et atteint 1 Gbps en fonction de l'offre, le volume de téléchargement est illimité. Il n’y a pas de débit minimal garanti, en revanche, Orange a dimensionné son réseau afin de vous offrir un confort maximal de chaque connexion.	[-0.03173828,-0.076660156,-0.008728027,-0.036132812,0.078125,-0.007171631,-0.0013885498,-0.021850586,0.00024795532,0.020385742,-0.0063476562,0.05517578,0.034423828,-0.006011963,-0.020385742,0.084472656,0.0076904297,-0.024291992,0.006591797,0.099609375,-0.08984375,0.091796875,-0.033935547,0.010192871,0.033447266,-0.020263672,-0.005554199,-0.050048828,-0.034423828,-0.084472656,0.024047852,-0.037597656,-0.026367188,-0.025146484,0.026733398,-0.010437012,0.010620117,0.017944336,0.008544922,0.078125,0.0030670166,-0.009338379,-0.05126953,0.028320312,-0.011962891,-0.051757812,0.016601562,0.008728027,0.03491211,-0.0107421875,0.037109375,0.010253906,-0.052978516,-0.024902344,0.029907227,0.017089844,0.04638672,0.06591797,0.040771484,0.018920898,-0.084472656,-0.005645752,-0.015625,-0.037353516,0.02709961,0.037841797,0.027709961,-0.041015625,-0.00022983551,-0.029907227,0.0037994385,-0.02331543,-0.013366699,0.007751465,-0.036132812,0.07910156,-0.028076172,0.020263672,0.0037078857,0.0017471313,0.004180908,-0.0066223145,-0.02368164,-0.014343262,-0.010314941,0.04248047,0.034423828,-0.050048828,-0.022583008,0.0057678223,0.061523438,-0.039794922,-0.017456055,0.0064086914,-0.03173828,-0.048828125,0.021850586,0.041015625,-0.052490234,-0.029052734,-0.0051574707,-0.022827148,0.0074157715,-0.018798828,-0.03491211,0.024047852,-0.07324219,-0.0059509277,-0.018554688,-0.06298828,0.036621094,-0.014221191,-0.044677734,0.0066223145,-0.035888672,0.035888672,-0.0067749023,0.0016098022,0.017944336,0.0008773804,0.02368164,-0.03564453,0.02734375,-0.013977051,0.01770019