130fa370-2994-4ef3-8b88-173114bf7ce7	# Business Box Fibre\n## En savoir plus\n### Est-ce que Orange se charge de rendre internet disponible dans toutes les espaces de l'entreprise ?\n\nLe technicien d’installation vous indiquera le point de chute de la fibre Optique de Orange en fonction de l'architecture et des contraintes techniques de votre entreprise. Les équipements de connexion doivent être installés en fonction de ce point de chute. Notre routeur Wifi fournit une bonne couverture. Orange n'est pas responsable de votre câblage interne et ne peut prendre en charge les travaux de réalisation et/ou de réparation de ce câblage. Orange vous propose également des répéteurs Wifi pour booster votre signal, disponibles dans l’un de nos points de vente	[0.005706787,-0.039794922,-0.010131836,-0.07128906,0.048095703,-0.009643555,0.040527344,-0.024414062,0.0045776367,0.030029297,0.05029297,0.015380859,-0.04296875,-0.007507324,-0.029052734,0.075683594,-0.0017700195,0.00793457,-0.030639648,0.087890625,-0.10839844,0.07373047,0.03930664,0.040039062,-0.01953125,0.014038086,-0.014526367,0.03881836,-0.052978516,-0.07080078,0.025756836,-0.044921875,-0.022705078,0.01928711,0.026489258,-0.010375977,0.013183594,-0.020507812,-0.011108398,0.075683594,0.018310547,0.0077819824,-0.028930664,0.026367188,-0.041259766,-0.032958984,-0.014526367,-0.023803711,-0.022827148,0.024291992,0.079589844,0.0056152344,-0.08642578,-0.008178711,-0.011047363,0.01171875,0.010131836,0.072265625,0.057861328,0.032958984,-0.051513672,0.0014419556,-0.07763672,-0.020263672,0.009765625,0.034423828,0.021484375,-0.033691406,-0.072265625,-0.017456055,0.03881836,0.060546875,-0.013549805,0.026245117,-0.0067443848,0.09326172,0.030883789,0.014465332,0.015258789,-0.0029296875,0.030029297,-0.002166748,-0.022094727,-0.0013656616,0.01361084,0.026367188,0.06347656,-0.021362305,-0.0037384033,0.056152344,0.07714844,0.0061035156,0.030517578,-0.06225586,0.014038086,-0.014160156,-0.01159668,0.061767578,-0.08300781,-0.033447266,-0.0