d56ca49c-d163-4f3b-b39f-1f953621f5c2	# Business Box Fibre\n## En savoir plus\n### Qu’est ce que le partage d’infrastructures ?\n\nCela signifie que, Orange Maroc utilise des infrastructures mutualisées avec d’autres opérateurs pour offrir à tous ses clients une connexion internet rapide, fiable et performante, sans compromis sur la qualité du service. Nos équipes continuent d’étendre le réseau fibre pour couvrir davantage de zones. Dès que c’est fait, vous êtes automatiquement migré sans frais et sans résiliation.	[-0.003250122,-0.08886719,-0.010131836,-0.061035156,0.05859375,-0.03112793,0.018310547,-0.030517578,0.020874023,0.022949219,0.02709961,0.019897461,-0.024902344,-0.008422852,-0.028564453,0.08300781,-0.01159668,0.018188477,-0.05908203,0.055908203,0.008605957,0.013000488,-0.012756348,0.076171875,-0.020141602,-0.0045166016,-0.009643555,-0.025634766,-0.0008010864,-0.08154297,0.020629883,-0.04736328,-0.010070801,-0.022949219,0.03540039,-0.011657715,0.038330078,-0.059326172,-0.017822266,0.061279297,-0.010131836,-0.007537842,-0.025390625,0.05126953,-0.005340576,-0.06298828,0.0390625,-0.0050964355,-0.015380859,0.020996094,0.07128906,0.013671875,-0.061279297,-0.0047912598,-0.012756348,0.03466797,0.021484375,0.08496094,0.04272461,0.03564453,-0.023071289,-0.001739502,-0.04736328,0.00075912476,0.0059814453,0.05444336,-0.009399414,-0.050048828,-0.0119018555,0.00061798096,-0.00041007996,-0.024780273,-0.033691406,0.015136719,0.00041007996,0.049804688,0.041503906,-0.0039978027,0.015258789,-0.016113281,-0.01965332,-0.0017700195,-0.05859375,0.041748047,0.0022277832,0.04272461,0.027709961,-0.009643555,-0.009033203,0.0390625,0.026245117,-0.0023651123,-0.021606445,-0.02734375,-0.006500244,-0.011230469,-0.012512207,0.044189453,-0.036621094,-0.025390625,0.018798828,-0.0138549805,0.032470703,-0.0011672974,-0.037353516,0.036621094,-0.05810547,-0.003829956,-0.041503906,-0.07373047,0.025268555,-0.026123047,-0.06982422,0.025024414,-0.03491211,0.03173828,0.059326172,-0.03112793,0.01416