9580402f-5eb9-4943-957e-49d06e509830	# Lan to Lan\n\n* [Le service Lan to Lan](https://entreprise.orange.ma/Solutions-Business/Fixe/Solutions-de-Connectivite/Lan-to-Lan#address-ea2aad46384a82aa5bbd9e47a7bfadac)\n* [Avantages](https://entreprise.orange.ma/Solutions-Business/Fixe/Solutions-de-Connectivite/Lan-to-Lan#address-71f2754ea8e7203473aebee03ff8368b)\n* [Architecture](https://entreprise.orange.ma/Solutions-Business/Fixe/Solutions-de-Connectivite/Lan-to-Lan#address-a66dcac242e383f0a936e65ed9708eb2)\n\nLe service Lan to Lan Avantages ArchitectureLe service Lan to Lan\n[Je suis intéressé](https://www.orange.ma/Quiz/Formulaire-Prise-d-interet)\nLe service Lan to Lan vous permet d'interconnecter tous vos sites et réseaux locaux avec le confort et la souplesse d'un LAN étendu.\nLe réseau Ethernet VPLS d'Orange vous assure un haut niveau de sécurité et de performance.\nVos collaborateurs bénéficient ainsi d'un réseau Ethernet très évolutif, avec des débits allant de 256 Kbps à 1 Gbps en zone dense pour accéder à toutes les ressources de l'entreprise : partage de documents, messagerie, travail collaboratif, etc.	[0.0076904297,-0.033935547,-0.012207031,-0.09082031,0.044433594,-0.0076293945,0.003326416,-0.024902344,0.016601562,0,0.021850586,0.061523438,-0.0039978027,-0.011962891,-0.040771484,0.12451172,-0.076171875,0.010925293,-0.040527344,0.0546875,-0.060058594,0.06738281,-0.0115356445,0.09033203,-0.0030517578,-0.068847656,-0.048095703,0.002090454,-0.006134033,-0.052246094,-0.012634277,-0.017456055,-0.022216797,-0.016845703,0.025390625,-0.014160156,0.030883789,-0.021972656,0.0061035156,0.08935547,0.03466797,0.020385742,0.0021514893,0.0039367676,-0.0018463135,-0.052246094,0.030761719,0.036376953,-0.027832031,-0.026489258,0.0027770996,0.022338867,-0.044677734,0.015014648,-0.024780273,-0.025390625,0.026489258,0.071777344,0.051513672,-0.006011963,-0.05053711,0.041259766,-0.05810547,0.012878418,0.020874023,0.016113281,0.05908203,-0.053222656,-0.075683594,-0.038330078,0.01062