218957d1-a810-42eb-81f7-729d1b354292	# Micro-Soc Enterprise\n## Les cyberattaques n’arrivent pas qu’aux autres !\n### Pourquoi anticiper les cyberattaques ?\n\nIl s’écoule un laps de temps important entre le moment où le hacker s’infiltre sur votre SI et celui où il chiffre vos données. Si les anomalies sont détectées au plus tôt, il est possible de les contrer avant qu’elles ne se déploient plus largement.	[-0.0014801025,-0.040283203,-0.005554199,-0.009521484,0.068359375,-0.015136719,-0.057128906,0.029174805,-0.017578125,-0.047607422,0.07714844,-0.095703125,-0.030029297,-0.0025024414,-0.024780273,0.04663086,0.012451172,-0.07910156,-0.010803223,0.01184082,-0.026489258,0.04736328,-0.016845703,0.09033203,0.012451172,-0.040771484,-0.002243042,0.049316406,-0.08154297,0.021606445,0.007171631,0.0099487305,0.033935547,-0.016113281,0.04248047,-0.0073242188,0.018310547,-0.0018386841,-0.012756348,0.015136719,0.037109375,0.005554199,0.024169922,0.036132812,0.017089844,-0.063964844,0.031982422,-0.076660156,-0.049072266,-0.0005722046,0.012145996,0.048583984,-0.05078125,-0.0034484863,0.01940918,0.003540039,0.0014343262,-0.033203125,0.010681152,-0.024658203,-0.068847656,0.051757812,-0.05883789,-0.0035095215,0.0023956299,0.03955078,-0.0011367798,-0.05419922,-0.017089844,0.0056152344,-0.022094727,0.02746582,0.04296875,0.015136719,-0.012939453,0.068359375,0.008666992,0.02722168,-0.0013885498,0.10644531,0.012390137,0.083984375,0.034179688,-0.009521484,0.013000488,0.007507324,-0.00077056885,-0.05493164,0.015380859,-0.022949219,-0.015197754,-0.006134033,-0.049804688,0.037353516,-0.036376953,-0.020385742,-0.024902344,0.01574707,-0.0027618408,-0.008666992,0.03857422,0.0134887695,0.04248047,-0.036621094,-0.025878906,0.040283203,0.007537842,-0.044189453,-0.017822266,-0.03173828,0.018188477,0.00680542,-0.036621094,0.02746582,-0.05493164,0.010131836,-0.0039978027,0.011291504,-0.005065918,-0.041503906,0.021972656,0.0014648438,0.015380859,-0.024169922,0.059326172,-0.0037078857,-0.036621094,-0.0