0527c3f8-be9f-48c2-9d63-8c492788e305	# Non réception d’une recharge effectuée en ligne\n\nNon réception d’une [recharge effectuée depuis le site Web Orange.ma](https://espace-client.orange.ma/e-recharge/identification), Orange et moi ou bien à partir d’une application bancaire :\n* Assurez-vous que la transaction a été effectuée avec succès.\n* Consultez votre solde de recharge depuis votre [espace client](https://espace-client.orange.ma/) ou bien [l'application Orange et moi](https://orangemaroc.page.link/appli).\n\nSi vous avez plusieurs numéros inscrits sur votre espace client, assurez-vous que la consultation de solde s’effectue sur le numéro de la ligne qui a fait l’objet de la recharge.\n* Vous pouvez joindre un de nos conseillers sur [WhatsApp](https://wa.me/212663121121?text=Bonjour) au 0663121121 ou bien en ligne au 121.	[-0.05126953,0.01184082,-0.0065307617,-0.052734375,0.023071289,-0.006866455,0.03100586,0.0099487305,-0.053955078,0.040771484,0.0048828125,-0.006134033,0.009765625,-0.007171631,-0.049804688,0.08154297,-0.011657715,-0.068359375,0.060546875,0.076171875,-0.0063476562,-0.010253906,0,0.08154297,0.03173828,-0.029418945,-0.025024414,0.0022125244,-0.02734375,-0.005126953,0.047607422,-0.03466797,-0.018310547,-0.011108398,-0.009399414,-0.008911133,0.0021209717,-0.010131836,0.008483887,0.024902344,-0.016113281,-0.009521484,0.04272461,0.028686523,-0.056640625,-0.019897461,0.044677734,-0.0004386902,0.03149414,-0.021606445,0.005554199,-0.00592041,-0.067871094,0.012512207,0.0099487305,0.014465332,0.03857422,0.03100586,0.021972656,0.015991211,-0.046875,0.019165039,0.015014648,-0.022705078,-0.018554688,0.02734375,0.040527344,-0.03955078,-0.109375,-0.061279297,0.021850586,0.017333984,-0.015319824,0.02746582,-0.032226562,0.034179688,0.036865234,0.014099121,-0.0002670288,-0.0043029785,0.028930664,0.0025482178,-0.020385742,0.06640625,0.0067443848,0.048339844,0.024536133,0.018798828,0.015014648,0.007598877,0.021606445,0.05126953,-0.010314941,0.005706787,-0.024414