301cc43d-68c0-4439-87fa-0dd1135545fa	# Choisissez vos forfaits mobile\n## Orange Pro\n### Les autres avantages Pro\n\n* * *\nGénérosité\nUn catalogue complet comprenant diverses gammes de forfaits incluant : appels nationaux, internationaux, internet 4G, SMS et roaming répondant à vos besoins et ceux de vos collaborateurs.\nFlexibilité\nGestion de votre flotte grâce à des formules adaptées à chacun de vos collaborateurs et pouvant s’adapter à l’évolution de leurs besoins.\nAutonomie\nUne multitude d’outils mis à votre disposition vous permettant de gérer votre parc en toute autonomie : consultation et paiement de factures, suivi de consommation, gestion des opérations, achats de Pass et recharges…\nAccessibilité\nLe réseau 5G est accessible dans les zones couvertes 5G et nécessite un smartphone compatible 5G. À défaut, le smartphone bascule automatiquement sur la 4G.	[-0.020141602,-0.057617188,-0.010314941,-0.078125,0.13378906,-0.006439209,0.076171875,0.019897461,0.024902344,-0.0026245117,-0.010681152,0.026123047,0.022827148,-0.007537842,-0.041015625,0.036132812,-0.063964844,0.01171875,-0.022949219,0.063964844,-0.04736328,0.03491211,-0.01928711,0.06542969,0.045898438,-0.040039062,0.02734375,-0.0030670166,-0.033691406,-0.03125,0.008666992,-0.03930664,-0.02758789,-0.00592041,0.03491211,-0.011169434,0.008483887,-0.016967773,-0.019897461,0.04248047,-0.015380859,-0.0013885498,-0.03930664,-0.009765625,-0.017089844,-0.033203125,0.03881836,0.020996094,-0.0008506775,0.006958008,0.033935547,0.04272461,-0.037353516,0.005859375,0.040039062,0.013061523,0.06225586,0.07470703,0.026367188,0.053466797,-0.053222656,-0.004638672,-0.044921875,-0.009338379,-0.014343262,0.028198242,0.05029297,-0.037353516,-0.034423828,-0.03857422,-0.03540039,0.010375977,-0.04345703,-0.028076172,-0.00982666,0.06298828,0.010009766,-0.001663208,0.025268555,0.0032653809,0.028320312,-0.0056152344,0.032714844,0.040527344,0.0043945312,0.068847656,0.02709961,-0.049072266,0.022216797,0.0099487305,0.056152344,-0.0