a011a6a6-e9d0-483f-85a0-246bccb009ed	# Choisissez vos forfaits mobile\n## Orange Pro\n### Consulter ma facture\n\nLa e-Facture Orange est un service simple, pratique et rapide qui vous permet de consulter directement vos factures en toute sécurité 24h/24 et 7j/7.\nVous pouvez accéder à vos 12 dernières factures en ligne depuis votre espace client Orange entreprise\n<https://espace-entreprise.orange.ma/sso/login> ou depuis l’application Orange pro dans la rubrique « Mes factures ».\nVous pouvez télécharger vos factures sous format XLS ou PDF. Vous recevrez également un email pour vous informer que la facture est disponible sur votre espace client.	[-0.025756836,-0.010253906,-0.00592041,-0.07861328,0.049804688,-0.009277344,0.025146484,-0.0034179688,-0.014953613,-0.023925781,-0.022583008,-0.021850586,0.04736328,-0.004638672,-0.028930664,0.06542969,-0.05517578,0.0032196045,0.03881836,0.068847656,-0.03857422,0.018188477,-0.014160156,0.02368164,0.010253906,-0.057373047,0.043945312,-0.015991211,-0.047851562,-0.037353516,0.07324219,-0.051513672,-0.035888672,0.020141602,0.023925781,-0.006439209,0.018920898,-0.0073242188,-0.004119873,0.052978516,0.023803711,0.014404297,-0.003753662,0.005218506,-0.04663086,0.0016021729,0.002960205,0.029296875,0.022216797,-0.0018615723,0.036132812,0.018310547,-0.044921875,0.01977539,0.035888672,-0.013061523,0.025024414,0.060791016,0.03125,0.037353516,-0.02758789,0.005584717,-0.032958984,-0.016601562,0.021728516,0.0030975342,0.029541016,-0.02355957,-0.09326172,-0.029052734,0.028808594,0.0040283203,-0.04321289,0.026855469,-0.021728516,0.07861328,0.013061523,0.03112793,0.024414062,-0.005065918,0.015991211,0.008178711,0.00025177002,0.0019073486,-0.015625,0.041748047,0.045166016,-0.007873535,0.0126953125,-0.00970459,0.05444336,0.01965332,-0.01184082,0.033935547,-0.010314941,-0.024780273,0.0006599426,-0.016479492,-0.063964844,-0.05834961,0.014953613,-0.017700195,0.03881836,-0.01361084,-0.026611328,0.071777344,-0.060302734,-0.015991211,0.017211914,-0.