c5fa1c9d-1a6b-4d2e-bea6-7f6a8425f79c	# Choisissez vos forfaits mobile\n## Orange Pro\n### Suivre votre consommation\n\nLa facturation détaillée vous permet de suivre en toute transparence, le nombre d’appels, les numéros appelés et la durée des appels.\nLe service « Facturation détaillée » est gratuit.\nPour les gestionnaires de flotte, ce service est accessible depuis l’espace client orange entreprises <https://espace-entreprise.orange.ma/sso/login> dans la rubrique « Mon parc ».\nPour les collaborateurs, le suivi de consommation est accessible depuis l’application Orange et moi.	[-0.036376953,-0.053466797,-0.009155273,-0.06201172,0.076171875,-0.032226562,0.033691406,0.035888672,0.0030975342,0.011657715,0.004486084,-0.018554688,0.049316406,-0.006713867,-0.03515625,0.0703125,-0.04248047,-0.037841797,0.0063476562,0.08300781,-0.04296875,0.007751465,-0.05419922,0.039794922,0.0099487305,-0.033691406,0.064453125,-0.016235352,-0.052490234,-0.014465332,0.03930664,-0.05493164,-0.022949219,0.011413574,0.010864258,-0.009094238,-0.014465332,-0.029541016,0.005340576,0.039794922,-0.016601562,0.0015411377,-0.048828125,0.024780273,-0.022705078,-0.020019531,0.010437012,0.011474609,-0.0017318726,0.003967285,0.012573242,-0.005432129,-0.05493164,-0.0020751953,0.024902344,-0.0019683838,0.03515625,0.05810547,0.03149414,0.036376953,-0.028930664,0.03173828,-0.052978516,-0.03100586,0.021240234,0.02368164,0.013916016,-0.04736328,-0.08251953,-0.04248047,0.018920898,-0.040283203,-0.048339844,0.008483887,-0.016845703,0.064941406,0.028930664,0.022583008,0.01940918,0.022705078,0.040283203,-0.00793457,-0.0026397705,0.01965332,-0.0060424805,0.064453125,-0.016113281,-0.038085938,0.014587402,0.014526367,0.048583984,-0.0126953125,-0.07373047,0.03466797,-0.03930664,-0.01550293,-0.024169922,0.008483887,-0.0625,-0.05078125,0.025634766,-0.015258789,0.0071411133,-0.025390625,-0.020874023,0.04272461,-0.071777344,-0.024902344,-0.0061035156,-0.05126953,0.008361816,-0.012817383,-0.013427734,-0.007385254,-0.05