ba39be93-518d-4650-8cca-bb8862f80362	# Choisissez vos forfaits mobile\n## Orange Pro\n### Comprendre vos factures\n#### Si vous avez souscrit à votre abonnement avant le 04 Novembre 2019 :\n##### Exemple d’illustration :\n###### Si vous avez souscrit votre abonnement après le 04 novembre 2019 :\n\nVotre cycle de facturation commence le 1er de chaque mois et se termine le 30 ou 31 du mois en cours. Une notification par mail vous est envoyée dès que la facture est disponible. Vous pouvez alors la consulter sur votre espace client orange entreprises <https://espace-entreprise.orange.ma/sso/login> ou depuis l’application Orange pro dans la rubrique « Mes factures ».\n\n_	[-0.05859375,-0.013916016,-0.008300781,-0.107421875,0.103515625,-0.0079956055,0.013671875,0.02331543,-0.017700195,-0.044921875,-0.010864258,-0.037353516,0.061523438,-0.006134033,-0.026733398,0.064941406,-0.056640625,-0.033447266,0.044921875,0.076171875,-0.04345703,-0.010498047,-0.007293701,0.026611328,0.034423828,-0.061523438,0.08251953,0.01928711,-0.04711914,-0.026733398,0.05810547,-0.03881836,-0.018798828,-0.015991211,0.020385742,-0.009094238,-0.0023498535,-0.039794922,-0.008300781,0.05859375,0.0069274902,0,-0.021484375,0.008911133,-0.017333984,0.010070801,-0.021362305,0.018798828,0.033935547,-0.0016555786,0.021118164,0.04321289,-0.06640625,0.019042969,0.04663086,-0.012207031,0.01953125,0.047851562,0.033935547,0.0054016113,-0.03930664,0.015136719,-0.0030822754,-0.038330078,0.003753662,-0.004119873,0.044189453,-0.032226562,-0.072265625,-0.02368164,0.019042969,0.011474609,-0.00970459,0.017211914,-0.024414062,0.055664062,0.013916016,-0.0050964355,0.037109375,0.005340576,0.051513672,-0.00046539307,-0.0037384033,0.0146484375,-0.0013580322,0.071777344,0.020385742,-0.04272461,0.008850098,-0.012023926,0.013305664,0.016967773,-0.016845703,0.020629883,-0.016113281,-0.0059814453,-0.03881836,-0.022583008,-0.053955078,-0.059814453,0.017944336,-0.0138549805,-0.017578125,-0.022949219,-0.022094727,0.049072266,-0.0502