e99b2e81-03fc-4d6e-bdc7-38a93ad30211	# Choisissez vos forfaits mobile\n## Orange Pro\n### Comprendre vos factures\n#### Si vous avez souscrit à votre abonnement avant le 04 Novembre 2019 :\n##### Exemple d’illustration:\n\n_\nUne facture émise le 1/04 correspond à la facturation du cycle qui s’étale entre le 1er au 31/03. Les rajouts de toute offre Orange d’un client ayant une 1ère souscription d’offre avant le 4/11/2019 suivront le cycle de facturation du 18 au 17 et non celui du cycle calendaire, même si les rajouts se font après le 04/11/2019.\nAssistance en ligne\nPowered by	[-0.049072266,-0.021118164,-0.009033203,-0.072753906,0.103027344,0.023071289,-0.0029754639,0.0115356445,-0.025024414,-0.055664062,0.003967285,-0.052490234,0.052734375,-0.0065612793,-0.030517578,0.076660156,-0.048583984,-0.03149414,0.02758789,0.0859375,-0.016113281,-0.020996094,0.0028076172,0.03930664,0.03100586,-0.04736328,0.06298828,0.020996094,-0.029785156,-0.03491211,0.051513672,-0.030395508,-0.049804688,-0.012451172,0.043701172,-0.010131836,-0.011108398,-0.06347656,-0.018432617,0.043701172,0.0010986328,-0.0066223145,-0.0546875,0.0087890625,0.015258789,0.008056641,-0.013000488,0.026611328,0.041015625,0.008972168,0.0119018555,0.053222656,-0.044677734,0.024658203,0.045166016,-0.028076172,0.026489258,0.041748047,0.027954102,-0.0126953125,-0.025756836,0.006500244,0.011413574,-0.04663086,0.031982422,-0.0039367676,0.037353516,-0.037109375,-0.057128906,-0.0040893555,0.016113281,0.005218506,-0.025390625,0.019042969,-0.005645752,0.051513672,0.0024414062,-0.0065612793,0.01586914,0.016357422,0.06201172,0.008056641,-0.020629883,0.007446289,0.0029907227,0.06298828,0.007537842,-0.044433594,0.010986328,-0.010437012,-0.014404297,0.017333984,-0.044677734,0.036865234,3.0994415e-05,-0.015991211,-0.03857422,-0.03930664,-0.04638672,-0.051513672,0.011108398,-0.017578125,-0.021850586,-0.025146484,0.0025177002,0.04736328,-0.04711914,-0.007507324,-0.016235352,-0.021606445,-0.0013656616,-0.015197754,-0.00077056885