698d0c2d-a69e-44be-9e71-8111d9d03465	# Problème d’appels\n## Problème de réception d’appels\n\n* Assurez-vous que le téléphone est allumé et que l’intensité du signal réseau est suffisante.\n* Assurez-vous que le renvoi des appels n'est pas activé.\n* Assurez-vous que votre appareil exécute le logiciel le plus récent.\n\nSi le problème d’appel persiste malgré toutes les vérifications citées ci-dessus, il faudra déposer votre téléphone au magasin Orange le plus proche pour diagnostic et réparation.\n1	[-0.03149414,-0.03955078,-0.0074157715,-0.022583008,0.05859375,0.01977539,0.02746582,0.011108398,-0.053710938,0.016357422,0.026733398,-0.048095703,-0.04736328,-0.006591797,-0.029296875,0.083496094,-0.017578125,-0.038085938,0.07324219,0.041015625,-0.04638672,0.072753906,-0.021118164,0.057373047,0.042236328,-0.00592041,-0.006225586,0.052001953,-0.053222656,0.0056762695,0.03857422,-0.046875,-0.014404297,0.018432617,0.03149414,-0.0065612793,-0.033691406,-0.030029297,0.018310547,0.011169434,-0.038330078,-0.016601562,0.041748047,-0.02331543,-0.033691406,-0.032958984,0.049072266,-0.004272461,-0.008117676,-0.0075683594,0.036621094,0.007873535,-0.04711914,0.0015945435,0.03857422,-0.015991211,0.041259766,-0.00050354004,0.053955078,0.0234375,-0.041992188,-0.042236328,-0.041992188,-0.052246094,-0.00970459,0.020629883,0.015197754,-0.072265625,-0.08691406,-0.010375977,-0.012573242,0.061035156,-0.010253906,0.012756348,-0.028076172,0.08251953,0.041015625,0.018066406,0.017944336,0.010559082,0.01928711,-0.002243042,0.033447266,0.006134033,0.02319336,0.015136719,0.03112793,-0.034179688,0.031982422,0.00982666,0.031982422,-0.016601562,-0.0047912598,-0.06982422,-0.020507812,0.008666992,0.0008583069,0.027832031,-0.023803711,-0.044433594,-0.010925293,-0.001121521,0.0005187988,-0.007019043,-0.09082031,0.07421875,-0.08544922,0.021118164,0.072265625,-0.06738281,0.022583008,-0.018432617,-0.002105713,-0.0115356445,-0.016479492,0.025268555,0.0042419434,-0.026123047,0.016967773,-0.015625,-0.002792358