19932297-1766-4080-9e6b-623b2b0fe53c	# Smart Message+\n## En savoir plus\n### Puis-je envoyer des messages WhatsApp proactifs et assurer un support client automatisé ?\n\nOui. Smart Message+ vous permet d’envoyer des notifications proactives préconfigurées (templates) à vos clients, que ce soit pour des promotions, des rappels ou des informations transactionnelles. Vous pouvez également offrir un support client 24h/24 grâce à l’intégration d’un chatbot et, si besoin, assurer une prise en charge humaine via des agents en direct.	[-0.020141602,-0.0044555664,-0.0039978027,-0.04638672,-0.014953613,-0.092285156,0.052246094,0.01928711,-0.017578125,0.005432129,0.010314941,-0.047851562,0.0032653809,-0.004119873,-0.033203125,0.013366699,-0.068359375,-0.018920898,0.0014190674,0.001045227,-0.032958984,0.025512695,-0.056396484,0.07910156,-0.012817383,0.012145996,0.05102539,0.037109375,-0.008239746,0.04272461,0.0065612793,-0.032470703,0.021362305,-0.018798828,0.030761719,-0.00592041,-0.011962891,-0.032470703,0.029663086,0.041503906,0.014770508,0.00793457,0.053710938,0.005218506,-0.017211914,-0.010070801,0.017944336,-0.011047363,-0.0071105957,0.010864258,0.010009766,0.0065612793,-0.059814453,0.004852295,0.032226562,0.03564453,0.06298828,0.048095703,0.008544922,0.0043640137,-0.091796875,-0.0019683838,-0.107910156,-0.036132812,-0.025268555,0.051757812,0.046875,0.002746582,-0.033447266,0.018798828,-0.019165039,0.010192871,-0.0070495605,0.025268555,-0.03955078,0.060058594,0.02709961,0.055419922,-0.021240234,0.056396484,-0.0071105957,0.006866455,0.06640625,0.012939453,0.015563965,0.059326172,-0.0052490234,0.024047852,0.044189453,-0.022705078,0.036376953,0.006591797,0.0051574707,0.03112793,0.012451172,-0.032714844,-0.057617188,-0.0030975342,-0.029052734,-0.017456055,0.009216309,-0.0072631836,0.016845703,-0.032470703,-0.008972168,0.04272461,-0.051757812,-0.018798828,-0.0546875,-0.010437012,0.01928711,0.008972168,0.015563965,0.061523438,-0.025390625,0.007171631,0.0154418945,0.0062561035,